1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,280
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,500
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,720
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,940
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,600
Come with me. Come on.

6
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,290
Uh...

7
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,960
Looks like he doesn't want to go with you.

8
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,120
How is this any of your business?

9
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,440
But he belongs to me.

10
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,600
I hope this is clear now.

11
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,680
Let's go home.

12
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,400
Right,

13
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:22,200
Kanthi.

14
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,520
Are we that close now?

15
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,320
I think it's adorable.

16
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,320
Call me by my name more often.

17
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,360
Help me!

18
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,000
If Dad knows about this,

19
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,080
you're in big trouble.

20
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:32,960
If he does, then great.

21
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,000
So he will know that...
we love each other.

22
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,700
I've made it to the office.

23
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:02,340
I've made it to the university, too.

24
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,920
Okay. I'll pick you up this evening

25
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,300
to have dinner.

26
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:18,140
It says he's read it.

27
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,120
Why hasn't he replied yet?

28
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:30,440
Yes, Kanthi?

29
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:31,480
Gear.

30
00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:33,479
Why didn't you reply to my text?

31
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,520
Huh, I'm sorry?

32
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:37,979
Why haven't you replied

33
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,120
to my dinner invitation?

34
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:43,280
I thought you were just telling me.

35
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:46,080
So, are you coming?

36
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:49,560
Well, I...

37
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,000
I didn't say no, did I?

38
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,240
Mm.

39
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:01,080
I'll pick you up after class.

40
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,040
Right.

41
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,900
That's all.

42
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,880
Oh, wait.

43
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,360
Yes?

44
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,360
Uh...

45
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,600
Work hard, okay?

46
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,260
You've got this.

47
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:41,460
♫I've been wondering♫

48
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:45,579
♫What's it like to fall in love? (Do you know the answer?)♫

49
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,579
♫Can't find an answer from ChatGPT♫

50
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,720
♫Asking Gemini hasn't helped me at all♫

51
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:53,920
♫Only you can help me find out how to love♫

52
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:56,040
♫That's why I've been bothering you♫

53
00:02:56,060 --> 00:03:00,200
♫I'll be there no matter what you do, you do, you do♫

54
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:02,860
♫Please, teach me♫

55
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:07,160
♫What is love, love, love supposed to be?♫

56
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:11,570
♫Can someone teach, teach me
how it should be?♫

57
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:16,320
♫I saw people in love,
so I wanted some love for me♫

58
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:20,190
♫Wanna love, love, so please help me♫

59
00:03:20,210 --> 00:03:21,480
♫Can you teach me?♫

60
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,720
Jay, what's wrong?

61
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:48,040
You look like you haven’t pooped in days.

62
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,320
Let me know if something's on your mind.

63
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,840
Hey, guys.

64
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:57,280
What are you two discussing?

65
00:03:57,520 --> 00:04:00,280
Uh... nothing, actually.

66
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,560
What about you?

67
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,160
I heard...

68
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,360
you were with Mr. Kanthi
last night, weren't you?

69
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:11,100
Well, well.

70
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,560
You're looking so lively today.

71
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,580
And you look so refreshed,

72
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,260
like you've "drunk" a lot of it.

73
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,600
Are you crazy?

74
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:21,200
He just dropped me off at home.

75
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,520
Nothing more than that.

76
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,000
Mm... Okay.

77
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,960
If you say so.

78
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,100
Jay.

79
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,080
You're not going live today?

80
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,100
You haven't streamed in days,

81
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,700
and... won't your engagement drop?

82
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,240
Shit...

83
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:40,880
I totally forgot.

84
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,720
Well, then...

85
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,280
How about this evening?

86
00:04:46,409 --> 00:04:47,090
Well?

87
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:49,480
If it's this evening...

88
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,820
I can't make it.

89
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,640
Oh?

90
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,000
Why not?

91
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,040
Well...

92
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,200
I have dinner plans with Kanthi.

93
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,080
Dinner?!

94
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,320
"Kanthi"?

95
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,280
Why are you guys shouting?

96
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,360
These days,

97
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:14,360
you two are so close that
you can just call him by his name?

98
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:17,540
I'm sure he's hitting on you.

99
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,920
I'm not really sure.

100
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,220
I think he is, though.

101
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,160
Why would he invite you to dinner, then?

102
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:30,520
Maybe he's hitting on our friend
because he's bored.

103
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,520
Let's not forget that

104
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,900
he's a total playboy.

105
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,600
Aren't you being
a little too negative here?

106
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,080
Maybe...

107
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,720
he just feels sorry for our friend.

108
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,400
So you don't think he might
actually like our friend here?

109
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,500
Let me go!
I told you to let go, Boss!

110
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:49,159
Let go!

111
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,200
Boss!

112
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,380
What are you doing?!

113
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,600
I told you to go away!

114
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:59,060
I told you to get off me!

115
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,400
Damn it!

116
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,840
You'll run away if I do!

117
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,240
Ow!

118
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,760
Let me go!

119
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,040
Let go!

120
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,920
Don't do this.

121
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,680
This changes nothing.

122
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,540
Nothing?

123
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,080
Do you know

124
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:21,320
how miserable I was
when you disappeared for five years?

125
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:24,320
I asked myself every single day

126
00:06:24,850 --> 00:06:26,000
what I'd done wrong

127
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,840
for you to disappear from my life.

128
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,200
Do you know how agonizing it was

129
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,600
to have a question with no answer?

130
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:42,800
Boss.

131
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,720
So, please,

132
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:51,240
don't tell me to end things between us.

133
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,680
Why aren't you struggling anymore?

134
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,040
If having sex this time

135
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:18,040
can atone for the wrongs
I’ve done to you,

136
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:20,920
I'll do it.

137
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:34,720
I was just curious

138
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,560
if you still loved me.

139
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,240
But now I've got my answer.

140
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:47,960
You can leave now.

141
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:51,940
I won't bother you anymore.

142
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:56,200
Boss.

143
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,360
Leave!

144
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:58,880
And what's your answer?

145
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,360
Shin...

146
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:54,920
Boss.

147
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,600
You're awake?

148
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,280
I thought you'd already left me.

149
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:12,920
If I were going to leave,

150
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,120
I would've already done it last night.

151
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:19,480
Don't leave me again.

152
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,840
Mm.

153
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:32,720
Move it.

154
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,840
Don't forget the other tasks too.

155
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,320
Sorry if I'm prying,

156
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,960
but you're not going to reply
to your boyfriend's texts?

157
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,760
Mm.

158
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,120
Until he decides

159
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,480
what to do next.

160
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,360
If he's ready to go public,

161
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,240
I'll keep this going.

162
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:07,680
If he isn't,

163
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,520
I'll end it.

164
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,560
You're going to break up?

165
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:17,720
Mm.

166
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,240
Just talk things through calmly, okay?

167
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:26,880
You can always talk things over with me.

168
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:29,660
Thanks.

169
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,440
Do you want me to wait for
Mr. Kanthi with you?

170
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,040
No need.

171
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:52,800
Guys.

172
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:53,840
I have to go now.

173
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,820
Right.

174
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,480
What's up with him?

175
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,260
I don't know.

176
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,520
Maybe he's...

177
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,200
going through a rough patch
in his relationship?

178
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,840
Jay already has a boyfriend?

179
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:17,160
I don't know.

180
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:18,960
I was just saying.

181
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:20,840
I'll be going, then.

182
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,320
- Bye.
- Mm.

183
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,880
- Take care.
- See you.

184
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,560
Did I keep you waiting?

185
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,360
Oh!

186
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:43,360
Kanthi. You scared me.

187
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,400
Why?

188
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,780
We've done much more than this before.

189
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,320
Oh, you!

190
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,040
Come on. Let's go.

191
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,960
I made a reservation for us.
We're running late.

192
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:09,480
Come.

193
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,380
Yes, Grandpa.

194
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,400
What's up?

195
00:13:19,540 --> 00:13:20,320
Huh?

196
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:22,040
I'm sorry?

197
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:30,720
Call me if anything comes up, okay?
[Emergency Room]

198
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,140
Grandpa!

199
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:34,380
- Gear?
- Hello.

200
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,720
How's Granddad?

201
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:37,900
He's still in the emergency room.

202
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,280
I don't know how he's doing right now.

203
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:42,620
And... how did he fall?

204
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:45,400
He took the beer cartons
into the bar himself

205
00:13:45,420 --> 00:13:47,120
without waiting for the workers.

206
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:51,440
I told him not to, but he wouldn't listen.

207
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:55,240
It's all my fault.

208
00:13:55,820 --> 00:13:59,780
If I’d kept a closer eye on him,

209
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:02,200
he wouldn't have carried
the beer cartons himself.

210
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,360
This isn't your fault, Grandpa.

211
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:09,520
Don't be too harsh on yourself.

212
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:10,960
He's right.

213
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:13,560
Besides, Granddad Keat is really tough.

214
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,360
He'll be okay.

215
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:26,840
Are you a relative of Mr. Keatprawat?

216
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,000
Yes.

217
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,380
How's he doing?

218
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:35,840
Fortunately, it's just fatigue.

219
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:37,280
Nothing serious.

220
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:39,840
The doctor says he only needs to
stay overnight for an IV drip.

221
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:41,360
Then he can go home tomorrow.

222
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,980
You can stop worrying now, Grandpa.

223
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:49,160
Once he wakes up, I'll have a word with him

224
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,160
so he won't be so stubborn next time.

225
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,200
I think...

226
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,320
you should go home and rest up.

227
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:01,120
I'll stay here tonight.

228
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,700
It's okay.

229
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:06,840
Let me stay with him.

230
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,240
Kanthi.

231
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,280
Drive him home, will you?

232
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,660
Absolutely.

233
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,200
Let's go, Gear.

234
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,320
But...

235
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,480
Let him drive you home.

236
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,320
I'm fine. Don't worry.

237
00:15:37,020 --> 00:15:37,920
Then...

238
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,080
I'll head home first.

239
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:42,440
But if anything comes up,

240
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:44,360
you can always call me.

241
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:46,600
Tomorrow,

242
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:49,120
I'll come and take you two home.

243
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,240
Let's go.

244
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,580
- Bye-bye, Grandpa.
- See you, Grandpa.

245
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,840
Are you hungry, Gear?

246
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,800
No, I'm not.

247
00:16:31,180 --> 00:16:32,520
Not even in the slightest?

248
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:34,280
Yes.

249
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:36,400
I'm starving, though.

250
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:38,280
Can we grab something first?

251
00:16:38,900 --> 00:16:40,120
It's up to you.

252
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:41,520
I'm fine with anything.

253
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,320
Then... let's go.

254
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,020
I'll take you to a good restaurant.

255
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:48,640
[Tanwarin Hospital]

256
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:50,660
[Rose Club]

257
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:05,400
Nu.

258
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,079
Please stop being upset with me.

259
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:10,480
I'm sorry

260
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:13,319
that I said bad things to you...

261
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:15,520
I didn't mean it.

262
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,880
Can we get back together, Nu?

263
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,320
Nu.

264
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,560
Can you stop ignoring me?

265
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:36,800
When you don't reply to
my messages for even a day,

266
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:39,320
I feel like I'm going to die.

267
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:41,020
And back then...

268
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:42,680
I really didn't mean it.

269
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,560
So, please, Nu.

270
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,760
Can we get back together?

271
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:57,120
I love you.

272
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,320
I love you, Nu.

273
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:19,680
Are you sure

274
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,320
you love me?

275
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:23,160
Of course.

276
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,760
If I didn't,

277
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,880
I wouldn't be here begging you like this.

278
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,560
Please... Nu.

279
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,160
Let's make up.

280
00:18:44,840 --> 00:18:46,240
If you really love me,

281
00:18:48,340 --> 00:18:49,400
prove it.

282
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,120
Fine.

283
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,840
Whatever you want me to do,

284
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:58,180
just tell me.

285
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,680
