569
00:42:00,420 --> 00:42:02,240
It's not your fault, Gear.

570
00:42:08,540 --> 00:42:09,360
Hey.

571
00:42:10,520 --> 00:42:12,520
Be honest with me, both of you.

572
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,960
Between you and Sand,

573
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:17,400
what exactly happened?

574
00:42:30,680 --> 00:42:32,040
Hey, guys.

575
00:42:32,680 --> 00:42:34,520
Help me pick out a gift for Kim.

576
00:42:35,780 --> 00:42:38,340
Valentine's Day is next week.

577
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:40,880
I want to get him a gift.

578
00:42:42,900 --> 00:42:44,040
Plus,

579
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:45,240
I want to

580
00:42:45,560 --> 00:42:47,720
confess my love to him, too.

581
00:42:50,040 --> 00:42:51,760
Are you sure he likes you?

582
00:42:53,600 --> 00:42:55,000
I'm not sure.

583
00:42:56,240 --> 00:42:57,840
But he's pretty friendly, isn't he?

584
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:01,600
I might have a chance.

585
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:18,680
Yes?

586
00:43:18,900 --> 00:43:19,640
Oh.

587
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:21,400
Oh, you've arrived?

588
00:43:21,900 --> 00:43:23,840
Okay. I'll be there in a moment.

589
00:43:23,860 --> 00:43:25,080
Hey, guys.

590
00:43:25,460 --> 00:43:27,960
I'm going to grab my bubble tea.
Be right back.

591
00:43:28,620 --> 00:43:30,160
Right. Okay.

592
00:43:35,560 --> 00:43:36,440
Gear.

593
00:43:37,440 --> 00:43:39,400
I think you need to tell Sand

594
00:43:39,620 --> 00:43:41,400
about you and Kim as soon as possible.

595
00:43:46,980 --> 00:43:49,040
I do want to tell him,

596
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,280
but you can see

597
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:54,160
how much he likes Kim.

598
00:43:56,560 --> 00:43:57,300
I...

599
00:43:58,000 --> 00:43:59,520
I'm worried I'd break Sand's heart.

600
00:43:59,720 --> 00:44:01,500
That part is inevitable,

601
00:44:02,360 --> 00:44:03,680
but I think he'll understand.

602
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:15,440
Hey, hey.

603
00:44:16,320 --> 00:44:18,340
Do you think Kim will say yes?

604
00:44:19,840 --> 00:44:21,280
What do you think, Pond?

605
00:44:23,900 --> 00:44:24,860
No clue.

606
00:44:24,880 --> 00:44:26,000
I think you...

607
00:44:26,360 --> 00:44:27,920
shouldn't get your hopes up, just in case.

608
00:44:29,100 --> 00:44:31,460
You always ruin my mood.

609
00:44:33,400 --> 00:44:35,580
What about you, Gear? What do you think?

610
00:44:48,600 --> 00:44:50,360
Hey, guys.

611
00:44:51,120 --> 00:44:52,800
Kim came all the way here to see me.

612
00:44:59,840 --> 00:45:00,720
Kim.

613
00:45:00,900 --> 00:45:01,840
Hello, Sand.

614
00:45:12,560 --> 00:45:13,440
Gear.

615
00:45:15,020 --> 00:45:15,720
Yes?

616
00:45:22,280 --> 00:45:23,480
Will you be my boyfriend?

617
00:45:39,920 --> 00:45:40,620
Yes.

618
00:46:00,660 --> 00:46:01,720
These are the flowers

619
00:46:02,360 --> 00:46:04,120
I prepared for Kim yesterday.

620
00:46:09,380 --> 00:46:11,440
Am I a clown to you, Gear?

621
00:46:12,480 --> 00:46:13,720
Is that why you did this to me?

622
00:46:16,820 --> 00:46:18,400
It's not like that.

623
00:46:18,960 --> 00:46:20,160
It's not?

624
00:46:20,780 --> 00:46:22,400
And it's like what, then?

625
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:25,940
I was madly in love with Kim,

626
00:46:26,520 --> 00:46:28,160
while you and he

627
00:46:28,700 --> 00:46:30,280
were seeing each other behind my back?

628
00:46:32,000 --> 00:46:33,920
If you didn't see me as a clown,

629
00:46:34,880 --> 00:46:36,360
then why did you do it?

630
00:46:37,480 --> 00:46:39,860
Gear had wanted to
tell you for a long time,

631
00:46:39,880 --> 00:46:41,320
but he just hadn't had the chance.

632
00:46:45,840 --> 00:46:47,520
So you knew from the beginning, too?

633
00:46:49,080 --> 00:46:49,880
So...

634
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:51,220
you knew,

635
00:46:52,200 --> 00:46:53,800
but you didn't tell me?

636
00:46:54,720 --> 00:46:56,380
Sand... It's not...

637
00:46:56,400 --> 00:46:57,460
I'm serious.

638
00:46:58,260 --> 00:46:59,620
Getting rejected by Kim

639
00:47:01,040 --> 00:47:04,080
doesn't hurt as much as being backstabbed

640
00:47:04,480 --> 00:47:06,360
by the two friends I trusted.

641
00:47:08,120 --> 00:47:09,240
Seriously, tell me.

642
00:47:10,480 --> 00:47:12,600
How could you do this to me?

643
00:47:13,240 --> 00:47:14,360
You two are...

644
00:47:15,560 --> 00:47:16,880
fucking pieces of shit.

645
00:48:00,280 --> 00:48:01,880
Was I really not in the wrong?

646
00:48:07,760 --> 00:48:08,560
Gear.

647
00:48:12,240 --> 00:48:13,160
Kim?

648
00:48:18,220 --> 00:48:19,840
Can I talk to you for a moment?

649
00:48:25,660 --> 00:48:26,840
How are you doing, Gear?

650
00:48:27,160 --> 00:48:28,120
Is everything alright?

651
00:48:30,440 --> 00:48:31,480
Could be worse.

652
00:48:33,440 --> 00:48:34,480
Kim...

653
00:48:35,860 --> 00:48:39,040
Just tell me what you want
to talk to me about.

654
00:48:39,320 --> 00:48:40,680
I don't want anyone to think

655
00:48:41,160 --> 00:48:42,520
I'm chasing after you again.

656
00:48:44,920 --> 00:48:47,140
I want to apologize for that video
on Sand's behalf.

657
00:48:48,920 --> 00:48:50,720
I actually knew nothing about it.

658
00:48:51,800 --> 00:48:53,640
But I was still involved,

659
00:48:54,600 --> 00:48:56,080
since I let them film you.

660
00:48:58,480 --> 00:48:59,280
Right.

661
00:49:02,400 --> 00:49:03,440
That's all, right?

662
00:49:07,240 --> 00:49:08,480
I've broken up with Sand.

663
00:49:15,160 --> 00:49:17,400
And... why are you telling me this?

664
00:49:24,760 --> 00:49:26,040
I miss you, Gear.

665
00:49:27,640 --> 00:49:28,840
Can we get back together?

666
00:49:51,200 --> 00:49:52,160
Gear.

667
00:49:56,280 --> 00:49:57,120
Kanthi?

668
00:50:15,290 --> 00:50:16,080
Gear.

669
00:50:16,100 --> 00:50:16,960
I'm happy

670
00:50:17,160 --> 00:50:18,960
you're still using the bag I bought for you.

671
00:50:19,000 --> 00:50:20,080
You're fucking happy, huh?

672
00:50:20,180 --> 00:50:21,320
Don't touch what's mine.

673
00:50:22,210 --> 00:50:23,400
Gear and I used to love each other.

674
00:50:23,440 --> 00:50:24,740
You're the one who came after!

675
00:50:24,760 --> 00:50:25,920
Hey, Kanthi!

676
00:50:26,030 --> 00:50:27,240
I'll buy you a new one.

677
00:50:27,330 --> 00:50:30,600
♫Happy birthday to you♫

678
00:50:30,700 --> 00:50:35,040
♫Happy birthday, happy birthday♫

679
00:50:35,510 --> 00:50:36,520
Thank you, Gear,

680
00:50:36,680 --> 00:50:37,840
for hosting my birthday party.

681
00:50:40,400 --> 00:50:42,040
And how did you know today's my birthday?

682
00:50:59,790 --> 00:51:03,200
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

683
00:51:03,220 --> 00:51:07,370
♫What love can be♫

684
00:51:07,390 --> 00:51:09,500
♫"Love" used to mean nothing♫

685
00:51:09,530 --> 00:51:14,880
♫Now it's starting to have meaning♫

686
00:51:14,900 --> 00:51:18,420
♫The love you gave me♫

687
00:51:18,440 --> 00:51:22,820
♫Was so fulfilling, helped me realize♫

688
00:51:22,840 --> 00:51:30,510
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫
